%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6626c84bb700413428bce8fec5aff79d, type: 3}
  m_Name: ChangingSubject
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _sameOptionTarget: 4
  _lines:
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I'm not really interested in having her be an emotional mess before
      I even outline my terms. She'll be in no state to accept at that point.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I'll just have to direct this conversation elsewhere...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "\u2026 Say, how do you manage to keep up with your hours anyway?"
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: From what I understand, you come to work on-time every day, with
      little to no extra help on the scene at that.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "Doesn't that kind of daily schedule seem too\u2026 demanding
      of someone like you?"
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 15eaf0d869902074ab9e4727a6d818aa, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Eh, it's not that bad.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5224f552d979b7d4c8e988245cdd9575, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Well, yeah, the customers are complete assholes, but the whole
      drink-mixing and food-serving thing is pretty easy if I'm gonna be honest.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Originally, I thought it was going to be so mind-numbingly boring...but
      you'd be surprised at how many people order crazy shit I've never seen before.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 051809b70c0d48749b41aef782cb1ee0, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "I swear some people just come in here asking me to make potions
      like I'm some sort of witch\u2026 it's honestly kind of hilarious seeing them
      try to come up with mixtures that'll straight up kill them."
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5224f552d979b7d4c8e988245cdd9575, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Buuut I gotta go by safety protocol or whatever so this place
      doesn't get shut down, so there's limits I gotta enforce or whatever...
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 15eaf0d869902074ab9e4727a6d818aa, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "It's also a little fun switching between a cafe and a bar every
      day; kinda keeps you on your toes\u2026 I guess."
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 85e73fbc318d21e4db7461e9136fd8c7, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Hehe, so satisfied by such simple routines. It's quite adorable
      to see you trying to make the most of your experience.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "So happy to run around and take orders like a submissive little
      dog\u2026 it's cute."
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e5765cb552eb0e743b1d025dd7e12a90, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: H-hey, that's NOT what it is!!!
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I'm not these people's servant or whatever; in fact, I'm the one
      that has the upper hand over them, okay??!!
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Sure, they ask me for the drink, but I get to control how good
      that drink is depending on if I think they deserve it!!
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c5a4eab48d0d997458a6e0e15d1ce34c, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: People who piss me off can just chug straight-up toxins for all
      I care!!! Or well, as long as it's within safety code...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 632048a77c40f4449afafb4f2cd57c28, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Suuuure. Like you could ever have any semblance of dominance over
      anyone.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 85e73fbc318d21e4db7461e9136fd8c7, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: You just get ordered about to satiate people's addictions without
      thought. I bet you like this job because you love being sooo obedient, don't
      you?
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: That's why you show up every day, isn't it? To be reminded of
      how much you love surrendering control to other people?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e5765cb552eb0e743b1d025dd7e12a90, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "Okay cut that out!!! That's\u2014just\u2014AGHHH STOP TALKING
      ABOUT IT!!!"
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "Pfft, so simple, so easily excitable\u2026 what a piece of work."
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Can she make her enjoyment of this any less obvious?
  _playerReplyOptions: []
  _npcReplies: []
  _gameEnd: 1
